  unitName: Drake Chief Aisha
  unitId: 10212
  unitNumber: 287
  description: A dragoon from Julep Village located in Amdahl, she found an injured
    fire dragon in a cave near her house at a young age, and gained its trust by
    sheltering it until its wounds were healed. She found out later that the fire
    dragon had escaped from the dragoons of Palmyna, she then decided she'd learn
    dragoon techniques herself so she could protect the dragon. At first, afraid
    of exposing her to danger, the dragon refused her, but eventually he gave in
    to her enthusiasm and granted her the entirety of his knowledge.
  summonDesc: You need my help?<br>I'll help if you do.<br>That's why I came to you.
  fusionDesc: I humbly receive this<br>token of good will.
